# Read by BuildKit in place of the root .dockerignore when this Dockerfile builds. The context is the Twitter root, so
# this is an allowlist: only what the Dockerfile copies (.mvn/, mvnw, the root pom, every module's pom, the shared
# module's src and this service's src) is sent. Add a COPY there and the path here.
*

!.mvn/
!mvnw
!pom.xml
!twitter_shared/pom.xml
!twitter_api_gateway/pom.xml
!twitter_tweet_service/pom.xml
!twitter_timeline_service/pom.xml
!twitter_mail_service/pom.xml
!twitter_shared/src/
!twitter_mail_service/src/

**/.DS_Store
**/*.iml
